---
import ServicePage from "../../layouts/ServicePage.astro";
import { business } from "../../data/business.js";
---
<ServicePage
  slug="radiators-central-heating"
  photoCategory="Radiators"
  title="Radiators and central heating"
  description={`Radiator fitting, replacement and central heating repairs across ${business.region} by a Gas Safe registered engineer. Free quotes.`}
  intro="New radiators, moving radiators, valves and heating repairs, with pipework run neatly and finished properly."
>
  <h2>Radiator work</h2>
  <ul class="tick-list">
    <li>New and replacement radiators, including designer and cast iron styles</li>
    <li>Moving radiators to a different wall or room</li>
    <li>Thermostatic radiator valves (TRVs) fitted, so you can control each room</li>
    <li>Leaking valves and radiators repaired</li>
    <li>Extra radiators added onto your existing system</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Central heating repairs</h2>
  <p>Common problems we fix include:</p>
  <ul class="tick-list">
    <li>Radiators not heating up, or the heating not coming on at all</li>
    <li>Leaks on pipework, valves and radiators</li>
    <li>Pumps, motorised valves and diverter valves</li>
    <li>Thermostats and heating controls</li>
    <li>Systems that keep losing pressure</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We'll find the cause, explain it in plain English and give you the price before any work starts.</p>
</ServicePage>
